---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
title="Mike Trounce — General Manager for Early/Growth Businesses"
description="I help founders get it all done."
>
<div class="page">
<aside class="skills skills-left">
<span class="skill">IT</span>
<span class="skill">Operations</span>
<span class="skill">Hiring people</span>
</aside>

<main class="wrap one-view">
<img class="hero-photo" src="/mike.jpg" alt="Mike Trounce" loading="eager" width="184" height="282" />

<h1 class="name">Mike Trounce</h1>
<p class="tagline">General Manager for Early/Growth Businesses</p>

<p class="pitch">
You're a founder, so you're probably good at something but have to do everything. I'll help you get the parts done that are not a good use of your time.
</p>

<ul class="skills-mobile">
  <li>IT</li>
  <li>Operations</li>
  <li>Hiring people</li>
  <li>Accounting &amp; finance</li>
  <li>Sales &amp; marketing</li>
  <li>Doing the work</li>
</ul>

<p class="contact-line">
Got something worth building? <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:trounceflow@gmail.com">trounceflow@gmail.com</a>
</p>
</main>

<aside class="skills skills-right">
<span class="skill">Accounting &amp; finance</span>
<span class="skill">Sales &amp; marketing</span>
<span class="skill">Doing the work</span>
</aside>
</div>
</Layout>
